{"name":"Art and Craft","hex":"#896956","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"art","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-2 & ISO 639-5 language code for artificial languages."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The conscious production or arrangement of sounds, colours, forms, movements, or other elements in a manner that affects the senses and emotions, usually specifically the production of the beautiful in a graphic or plastic medium.","The creative and emotional expression of mental imagery, such as visual, auditory, social, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/art"},{"term":"and","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Ansus."]},{"part":"Conjunction","definitions":["As a coordinating conjunction; expressing two elements to be taken together or in addition to each other.","Yet; but."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/and"},{"term":"craft","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Strength; power; might; force .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}.","Intellectual power; skill; art."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make by hand and with much skill.","To construct, develop something (like a skilled craftsman)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/craft"}],"entries":[{"title":"Handicraft","blocks":[{"text":"A handicraft is a traditional main sector of craft making and applies to a wide range of creative and design activities that are related to making things with one's hands and skill, including work with textiles, moldable and rigid materials, paper, plant fibers, clay, etc. Usually, the term is applied to traditional techniques of creating items that are both practical and aesthetic. Handicraft industries are those that produce things with hands to meet the needs of the people in their locality without using machines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/330px-Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handicraft"},{"title":"Art","blocks":[{"text":"Art is a diverse range of cultural activity centered around works utilizing creative or imaginative talents, which are expected to evoke a worthwhile experience, generally through an expression of emotional power, conceptual ideas, technical proficiency, or beauty."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Art-portrait-collage_2.jpg/330px-Art-portrait-collage_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Art"},{"title":"Craft","blocks":[{"text":"A craft or trade is a pastime or an occupation that requires particular skills and knowledge of skilled work. In a historical sense, particularly the Middle Ages and earlier, the term is usually applied to people occupied in small scale production of goods, or their maintenance, for example by tinkers. The traditional term craftsman is nowadays often replaced by artisan and by craftsperson."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Craft_fair_and_folk_festival_Bangladesh_2024_at_Sonargaon_museum_35.jpg/330px-Craft_fair_and_folk_festival_Bangladesh_2024_at_Sonargaon_museum_35.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Craft"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/500px-Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/500px-Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Batik craftswomen in Java, Indonesia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki